class Engine {

    Engine() {
        System.out.print("Engine ");
    }
}

class Car {

    Engine e = new Engine();

    Car() {
        System.out.print("Car ");
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Car c = new Car();
    }
}
===================================================output=====================================================================
Instance variables initialize before constructor body.
Order:

Engine object created
Car constructor executes

Output:    Engine Car
